Danish lexicon for Libre Tiles
Source: LibreOffice dictionaries da_DK (Stavekontrolden) at commit 75f5dff8c972fff4a32e4ea8434722c277f02a3f
LibreOffice Danish dictionary pack version 2023.09.05
SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-only OR LGPL-2.1-only OR MPL-1.1

The word list is derived by expanding the upstream affix file, preserving the three
Danish letters that have their own tiles, folding every other marked letter, and
dropping any form that still contains a letter no Danish tile bears; see the lexicon
header for why. The upstream README below carries the copyright and the three licence
options, and names the dictionary files it grants them for.

--- upstream README_da_DK.txt ---

